; Test 03: Return + join.  Cursor to line 2, column 10, Return (TED opens
; an empty line below, no split), JOIN (menu 1 8) joins it away again - the
; saved file equals the original (observed), SAVE.  Compared: file, dumps, memory balance (join leak
; BUG(orig) in both).
; @source T t02_float
; @est 4
; @expect same t02_float.bb2
; @expect bak t02_float.bb2.bak
timeout 10
wait req "OKEE DOKEE"
gad 1
wait screen
mem before
key 4d
key 4d
key 4e
key 4e
key 4e
key 4e
key 4e
key 4e
key 4e
key 4e
key 4e
key 4e
key 44
dump split
menu 1 8
dump joined
mem after
menu 0 2
wait freq "Name to save file as"
freq ok
wait screen
menu 0 9
wait exit
